    |
    v
UFCPS LEVEL 2
    |
    +-- Agent Swarm
    +-- Resource Swarm
    +-- Question Ledger
    +-- Task Prospect
    +-- Resource Aggregation
    +-- Swarm Scheduling
    +-- Compute Economy
    +-- Research / Investor proposals
