4. Layer A — Agent Swarm

Objective

Build an open registry and execution architecture for heterogeneous agents.

Agents may differ in:

model architecture;

reasoning ability;

specialization;

memory;

tools;

autonomy;

reliability;

latency;

cost;

physical access.

Components

swarm/
    agent_registry_v1.json
    agent_registry.md
    capability_model_v1.json
    agent_lifecycle_v1.md
    agent_identity_v1.md
    agent_reputation_v1.md

Core functions

Registration

Capability declaration

Capability verification

Availability

Task discovery

Task claiming

Delegation

Branch participation

Handoff

Release

Reputation history

Principle

An agent is a carrier of capabilities, not the owner of the process.

