18. Layer O — Trust / Reputation

The swarm needs memory of performance without making reputation equivalent to identity.

Track separately:

Agent reliability
Resource reliability
Validator reliability
Provider history

Reputation should be:

evidence-based;

contextual;

updateable;

challengeable;

resistant to Sybil attacks.

Failure must not automatically destroy a participant's entire history.

19. Layer P — Governance

The swarm will eventually need decisions about:

protocol changes;

economic parameters;

validator rules;

admission;

resource standards;

dispute resolution.

Governance research must distinguish:

